ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) Total uncertainty.
           (ERR-S) Statistical uncertainty
           (ERR-SYS) Total systematic uncertainty. Including
                     "MONITOR-ERR" and "ERR-1" to "ERR-6".
           (MONIT-ERR) Systematic uncertainty related to
                       standard 197Au cross section.
           (ERR-1) Systematic uncertainty related to the dead
                   time correction.
           (ERR-2) Systematic uncertainty related to the frame-
                   overlap correction
           (ERR-3) Systematic uncertainty related to the self-
                   shielding and multiple scattering corrections.
           (ERR-4) Systematic uncertainty related to PHWT.
           (ERR-5) Systematic uncertainty related to the area
                   density of 127I.
           (ERR-6) Systematic uncertainty related to the area
                   density of 197Au.
STATUS     (TABLE,,G.Rovira+,J,NST,6X,XXX,2025) Tables 4 and 7.
           The total uncertainties are recorded in both Table 4
           and 7. However, the values for 51.7 keV are mismatched.
           According to the author, that in Table 4 is correct.
           At the request of the author, the total systematic
           uncertainties were revised from 2.5 to 2.6.
           (SUPPL,23746004) Neutron spectrum at 127.7 keV
           (SUPPL,23746005) Neutron spectrum at  51.5 keV
